<title>Ovarian Tumor in Pregnancy: Management.</title>
<graphic href="eee0510-w0001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Potentially malignant adnexal mass in pregnancy. Type of mass?</label>
<path target="cell-2">Cystic</path>
<path target="cell-3">Solid</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>Follow-up ultrasound until approximately16 weeks. Increase in size or change in character?</label>
<path target="cell-3">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-4">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-4">
<label>Follow-up postpartum.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-3">
<label>Laparoscopy with histologic evaluation.</label>
<path target="cell-4">Benign</path>
<path target="cell-5">Malignant</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-5">
<label>Staging including laparotomy and histological diagnosis; chemotherapy at &gt;12-15 weeks' gestation.</label>
</cell>
</algorithm>
